					Alciphr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> as epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπήνη</span>,
				<i>well-wheeled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.58
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχοι</span>”
