				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1391
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of bandages,
				<i>in horizontal circles, orbicular</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.61
			</span></i> tit., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).786
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>moving in a circle, circling</i>, 
